            "text": "{\"task\":{\"created_at\":\"2026-10-29T06:09:37.593231Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-29T06:09:37.593231Z\",\"org_id\":\"01a18645-114a-7271-bac3-0eacd7245bcb\",\"project_id\":\"01a18645-f5b9-74b5-8eb7-21939b56ad1c\",\"id\":\"01a18647-3b37-7147-bf38-f4001fb62392\",\"title\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo $WALK_MARKER` in…\",\"display_index\":5,\"status\":\"pending\",\"kind\":\"eval\",\"member_id\":\"01a18645-115e-74d6-80b4-c71b3c7d1ada\",\"automation_id\":null,\"runtime_group_id\":\"01a18646-05b2-727f-9dbb-f20c47b9b9cd\",\"runtime_id\":\"01a18646-091f-7347-8dbe-8b829899973f\",\"is_archived\":false,\"started_at\":null,\"completed_at\":null,\"last_user_message_at\":\"2026-10-29T06:09:37.594185Z\",\"metadata\":{\"error\":null,\"suite\":\"walk\",\"commands\":true,\"agent_name\":\"scripted\",\"task_prompt\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo $WALK_MARKER` in the shell and reply in one short sentence.\\n\\n<<SCRIPT {\\\"reply\\\":\\\"Echoed the message through hello-mcp and wrote it to the outputs file.\\\",\\\"tools\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hello-mcp_echo\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"message\\\":\\\"hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"write\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Echo: hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"bash\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"command\\\":\\\"echo $WALK_MARKER\\\"}}]}>>\",\"active_run_id\":\"01a18647-3b37-7147-bf38-f3ff147cae28\",\"latest_run_id\":\"01a18647-3b37-7147-bf38-f3ff147cae28\",\"crash_restarts\":null,\"history_recall\":null,\"conversation_id